WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.840
Hanagaki, escape out the back.

00:08.920 --> 00:09.920
[gasps]

00:10.010 --> 00:11.010
[Takemichi] Naoto!

00:11.880 --> 00:13.470
What's wrong, Takemichi?

00:13.550 --> 00:15.300
-We've got to go back.
-What?

00:15.390 --> 00:16.970
-[Kisaki] Takemitchy.
-[gasps]

00:17.050 --> 00:19.560
[♪ suspenseful music]

00:20.220 --> 00:21.600
Kisaki…

00:21.680 --> 00:23.690
-Die.
-[grunts]

00:23.770 --> 00:25.060
[gunshots]

00:25.690 --> 00:28.520
[Naoto groans]

00:28.610 --> 00:30.690
Huh? Naoto!

00:31.280 --> 00:35.030
Naoto Tachibana was supposed
to be mine to kill, Kisaki.

00:35.110 --> 00:36.820
Sorry, Izana.

00:36.910 --> 00:38.740
He took the bullet meant for Takemitchy.

00:39.370 --> 00:40.370
Kakucho.

00:43.200 --> 00:44.540
Kaku-chan…

00:45.460 --> 00:46.460
Kill him.

00:47.000 --> 00:48.000
Yes, sir.

00:53.300 --> 00:55.590
-[gunshots]
-[body thuds]

00:55.680 --> 00:58.550
[Takemichi gasps]

01:00.720 --> 01:02.520
[Naoto] This will be our final handshake.

01:05.060 --> 01:07.310
[Takemichi]
<i>This won't be the last time, Naoto.</i>

01:09.230 --> 01:10.980
<i>There's no way</i>

01:12.360 --> 01:13.440
<i>I will ever give up!</i>

01:13.570 --> 01:14.740
[crackles]

01:15.990 --> 01:18.620
[Takemichi pants]

01:21.530 --> 01:22.580
[Takemichi] <i>Naoto…</i>

01:23.580 --> 01:24.620
<i>Naoto!</i>

01:25.330 --> 01:26.710
[Takemichi pants]

01:27.790 --> 01:29.170
[sighs]

01:29.960 --> 01:31.250
[Takemichi] <i>It's okay.</i>

01:31.340 --> 01:33.130
<i>There's no way Naoto would die!</i>

01:33.960 --> 01:36.840
Why'd you call me out here
so late at night?

01:37.430 --> 01:40.050
[Takemichi] <i>I'm sure I'll return
to the present when we shake hands.</i>

01:40.140 --> 01:41.470
[grunts]

01:46.140 --> 01:47.350
<i>I'm sure I can go back.</i>

01:50.020 --> 01:51.110
<i>Come on.</i>

01:51.610 --> 01:53.020
<i>Please!</i>

01:54.980 --> 01:56.400
Please!

01:58.910 --> 02:00.200
[Takemichi gasping]

02:01.570 --> 02:02.910
[Takemichi] <i>Naoto…</i>

02:02.990 --> 02:04.450
I'm Naoto Tachibana.

02:06.960 --> 02:09.370
[Takemichi]
<i>You were always there supporting me.</i>

02:11.460 --> 02:13.750
<i>I only made it this far
because you were there!</i>

02:15.170 --> 02:18.260
[sobbing]

02:18.340 --> 02:19.930
Naoto!

02:22.010 --> 02:24.100
[♪ theme music]

03:53.600 --> 03:54.600
[Naoto] Takemichi…

03:55.610 --> 03:56.900
Are you all right?

03:57.900 --> 03:59.940
[Takemichi] Yeah, I'm fine.

04:01.030 --> 04:03.820
-Sorry for calling you out so suddenly.
-[mutters]

04:04.530 --> 04:06.030
[Takemichi] You can go home now.

04:10.410 --> 04:11.450
[soft gasp]

04:12.290 --> 04:13.460
You're still here?

04:14.620 --> 04:15.920
I told you to leave.

04:18.840 --> 04:21.050
Hey, Naoto…

04:22.380 --> 04:25.390
Do you remember when we first met?

04:26.760 --> 04:29.600
Hina died, I traveled through time…

04:30.640 --> 04:35.770
You and I in the future kept trying
our very best to save Hina.

04:36.520 --> 04:39.320
But now I can't return
to the future anymore.

04:40.820 --> 04:43.190
The future you was the trigger,
but now you're dead.

04:44.780 --> 04:46.360
What do I do now?

04:49.740 --> 04:51.740
Guess there's no point in asking you.

04:52.750 --> 04:53.910
I know!

04:54.000 --> 04:56.370
I'll just change the past again.

04:57.250 --> 05:00.590
Then I can save Naoto, and save Hina.

05:01.420 --> 05:02.670
Awesome.

05:02.760 --> 05:04.970
That's it. Yeah, that's it.

05:05.430 --> 05:08.140
Then once I save everyone,
I'll return to the future.

05:09.350 --> 05:10.760
And I'll fail again

05:11.810 --> 05:13.390
and fail again…

05:16.100 --> 05:17.600
Forget it.

05:18.650 --> 05:21.610
Maybe… I'm just better off dead.

05:23.110 --> 05:24.320
[gasps]

05:26.400 --> 05:27.660
I love you.

05:29.070 --> 05:30.240
Hina?

05:30.330 --> 05:31.330
Yeah.

05:31.830 --> 05:33.750
[Takemichi] Huh? You heard all that?

05:34.120 --> 05:35.410
Yeah.

05:35.500 --> 05:38.420
I think you mistook me for Naoto.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.080
[Takemichi] <i>Oh, crap!</i>

05:40.170 --> 05:42.630
<i>I told her all about the future stuff.</i>

05:43.630 --> 05:46.380
[Hina] Takemichi, how old are you really?

05:46.470 --> 05:47.510
[Takemichi] Uh…

05:48.340 --> 05:49.510
Twenty-six.

05:50.970 --> 05:52.680
I won't ask you anything else,

05:53.060 --> 05:54.600
but tell me just one thing.

05:56.140 --> 06:01.020
Has the future Takemichi
proposed to me yet?

06:01.690 --> 06:02.980
No…

06:03.070 --> 06:04.070
Not yet…

06:04.150 --> 06:07.950
But I've always thought
it would be great if we got married.

06:08.030 --> 06:09.320
[Takemichi] <i>What the heck am I saying?</i>

06:09.410 --> 06:10.620
Really?

06:11.280 --> 06:12.780
Was that you proposing now?

06:12.870 --> 06:14.160
Yeah.

06:15.790 --> 06:17.250
Then I can

06:17.330 --> 06:18.620
die happy.

06:18.710 --> 06:20.000
[gasps]

06:21.750 --> 06:22.750
[Takemichi] <i>Hina…</i>

06:24.840 --> 06:25.840
[sniffles]

06:25.920 --> 06:29.180
<i>There's no way I'm giving up!</i>

06:34.140 --> 06:35.640
It's morning.

06:36.600 --> 06:37.890
Yeah.

06:40.140 --> 06:42.360
[groans]

06:42.440 --> 06:44.690
I'd better get back
before Mom and Dad get up.

06:45.270 --> 06:46.780
Hina, uh…

06:46.860 --> 06:48.900
[Takemichi] The stuff I said earlier

06:49.530 --> 06:52.240
about the future and stuff…

06:53.280 --> 06:55.200
I didn't hear any of that.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.410
Huh?

06:58.080 --> 06:59.120
Bye-bye!

07:03.380 --> 07:05.210
[Takemichi] <i>Thank you, Hina.</i>

07:06.170 --> 07:08.920
All right! I've got a ton of stuff to do!

07:09.630 --> 07:12.140
<i>After traveling through time again,
I now know who my enemy is.</i>

07:12.220 --> 07:16.220
<i>Izana Kurokawa,
the guy who wasn't in the other futures.</i>

07:16.890 --> 07:21.230
<i>Without a doubt, his existence
accelerated Mikey's descent into darkness.</i>

07:21.810 --> 07:25.190
<i>And Kisaki must be the one behind it.</i>

07:25.270 --> 07:27.320
<i>I'll crush Izana Kurokawa.</i>

07:27.650 --> 07:28.650
<i>Kisaki…</i>

07:28.730 --> 07:30.990
I'll hunt you down this time!

07:33.490 --> 07:36.030
<i>Whether Kisaki can travel
through time or not,</i>

07:36.120 --> 07:37.870
<i>Izana Kurokawa is the key now.</i>

07:38.450 --> 07:40.080
<i>What I want to know most now is…</i>

07:40.250 --> 07:42.960
But I do know that Manjiro Sano had

07:43.040 --> 07:46.590
even greater trust in Izana Kurokawa
than in Ken Ryuguji.

07:47.250 --> 07:51.300
[Takemichi] <i>Why would Mikey have
so much trust in Izana Kurokawa?</i>

07:52.300 --> 07:55.970
<i>Maybe Mikey has met
Izana Kurokawa already? </i>

07:56.100 --> 07:57.720
-[motorcycle engine rumbles]
-[grunts]

07:59.890 --> 08:01.100
Yo, Takemitchy.

08:01.680 --> 08:03.480
You're sure up early on a Sunday.

08:04.190 --> 08:05.560
SANO

08:07.190 --> 08:09.570
[chopping]

08:10.190 --> 08:12.820
Grandpa, wake up Mikey for me.

08:12.900 --> 08:14.280
[door opens]

08:15.620 --> 08:16.620
Huh?

08:16.700 --> 08:17.780
[Emma] It's about time!

08:18.200 --> 08:19.830
Food…

08:21.540 --> 08:23.160
Morning, Grandpa.

08:23.250 --> 08:24.250
Morning.

08:25.630 --> 08:30.000
[Mikey] Emma, I told you I like my eggs
over easy with the yolks crushed.

08:30.710 --> 08:31.920
Then do it yourself.

08:33.970 --> 08:36.220
[Emma] Toss out that old towel already!

08:36.300 --> 08:38.470
You've been fiddling with it
since you were little.

08:38.550 --> 08:40.560
No. It's my life.

08:41.180 --> 08:42.350
Pass the soy sauce.

08:42.430 --> 08:44.810
-[sighs]
-[doorbell dings]

08:44.890 --> 08:46.900
[Draken] I'm here, Mikey!

08:46.980 --> 08:49.190
Go wait in my room, Draken.

08:49.770 --> 08:53.190
I ran into Takemitchy on the way.
Can he come in too?

08:53.280 --> 08:54.320
[Mikey] Sure.

08:57.870 --> 08:58.990
[gasps]

08:59.120 --> 09:01.040
So this is Mikey's place.

09:01.490 --> 09:02.500
[Draken] This way.

09:04.500 --> 09:06.080
This is Mikey's room.

09:06.170 --> 09:08.750
[Takemichi] Whoa. It's separate
from the rest of the house.

09:09.250 --> 09:11.710
This was originally a shed.

09:12.510 --> 09:14.720
Shinichiro would work on bikes here.

09:14.800 --> 09:15.930
Really?

09:16.010 --> 09:17.640
We'd come here a lot.

09:18.220 --> 09:22.770
<i>Mikey and me, we'd watched Shinichiro
all day long as he worked on bikes.</i>

09:23.560 --> 09:24.980
We never got tired of it.

09:25.690 --> 09:26.940
Wow.

09:27.900 --> 09:31.480
[Takemichi] Whoa! Mikey's room is so cool!

09:31.570 --> 09:34.650
But don't you think
it has too much of a grown-up feel?

09:34.740 --> 09:37.200
Well, most of the stuff
belonged to Shinichiro.

09:37.280 --> 09:38.280
[door closes]

09:38.360 --> 09:40.660
[Mikey] The bed's the only thing
that's mine.

09:40.740 --> 09:42.160
[Takemichi] Mikey!

09:42.240 --> 09:44.250
Quit yelling. It's too early for that.

09:46.120 --> 09:47.210
[Mikey] I see.

09:48.210 --> 09:49.580
Izana Kurokawa.

09:50.170 --> 09:51.630
The guy who approached me.

09:51.710 --> 09:52.920
What? You've met him?

09:53.000 --> 09:54.050
Yeah.

09:54.670 --> 09:56.590
[Mikey] So he's Tenjiku's leader, huh?

09:57.800 --> 10:00.720
The eighth leader of BLACK DRAGON…

10:01.430 --> 10:04.020
Mikey… BLACK DRAGON…

10:05.560 --> 10:07.310
[Draken] Shinichiro?

10:07.390 --> 10:08.560
Huh?

10:08.640 --> 10:10.150
[Draken] Nah, there's no connection.

10:10.230 --> 10:13.940
Okay, Takemitchy,
I've got something to tell you.

10:14.480 --> 10:16.150
-Is it okay?
-Yeah.

10:17.950 --> 10:23.280
Mikey's brother, Shinichiro,
was the founder of BLACK DRAGON.

10:23.950 --> 10:25.330
He was the first leader.

10:25.910 --> 10:27.290
Yeah, okay.

10:27.370 --> 10:30.250
-What? That doesn't surprise you?
-[Takemichi] Huh?

10:30.330 --> 10:33.210
[Takemichi gasps]
<i>Oh, yeah! I learned that in the future!</i>

10:33.290 --> 10:36.840
Actually, I was so surprised
I could hardly talk.

10:37.340 --> 10:38.380
I see.

10:38.470 --> 10:43.390
And the only people who know this
are me, Mikey, and Baji…

10:44.720 --> 10:45.970
[Draken] That's about all.

10:47.180 --> 10:50.100
When we helped Kazutora
in his fight with BLACK DRAGON,

10:50.560 --> 10:55.320
we figured this info would only be
a hindrance to other members of Toman.

10:55.900 --> 11:00.780
I talked with my brother before we fought
the ninth generation BLACK DRAGON.

11:02.410 --> 11:03.740
[Shinichiro] I see.

11:04.200 --> 11:06.240
So you'll fight BLACK DRAGON.

11:06.910 --> 11:08.250
Shinichiro,

11:09.000 --> 11:12.120
BLACK DRAGON's not as cool
as they used to be.

11:12.210 --> 11:13.960
Yeah, I know.

11:17.590 --> 11:19.170
The eighth leader changed it.

11:20.590 --> 11:23.300
BLACK DRAGON was everything to me.

11:25.100 --> 11:27.520
Do what you want, Manjiro.

11:28.350 --> 11:31.350
BLACK DRAGON is the gang I left for you,

11:31.890 --> 11:34.270
for you to take it over.

11:38.530 --> 11:42.240
So it was the eighth generation
BLACK DRAGON leader who ruined it.

11:43.030 --> 11:44.910
In other words, Izana Kurokawa.

11:44.990 --> 11:46.120
[grunts]

11:46.200 --> 11:48.490
-[Takemichi] <i>There's the connection!</i>
-[door opens]

11:49.160 --> 11:51.460
Here, I brought you some tea.

11:52.290 --> 11:54.670
-Morning, Draken.
-Hi.

11:55.210 --> 11:59.300
So you didn't know
Izana Kurokawa before, Mikey?

11:59.800 --> 12:00.880
No, I didn't.

12:01.380 --> 12:02.510
He's my big brother.

12:04.140 --> 12:05.180
Huh?

12:05.260 --> 12:06.260
Who is?

12:06.890 --> 12:10.730
Like I said, he's my big brother,
Izana Kurokawa.

12:11.680 --> 12:12.690
[all] Huh?

12:14.730 --> 12:15.940
He's my big brother.

12:16.480 --> 12:17.570
You mean Mikey?

12:18.070 --> 12:19.610
No, not him.

12:22.190 --> 12:24.280
[inaudible]

12:24.860 --> 12:27.990
Hey, I've told you
a hundred times before, Mikey.

12:28.080 --> 12:31.000
He's your half-brother, you know.

12:31.080 --> 12:35.330
My last name used to be Kurokawa
and I had an older brother.

12:35.420 --> 12:37.080
Oh, is that right?

12:37.170 --> 12:42.590
He's Emma's brother…
so he and Mikey are brothers too?

12:42.670 --> 12:44.220
<i>This is shocking!</i>

12:44.300 --> 12:47.760
Darn you! You never listen to me!

12:47.850 --> 12:49.680
Oh, now I remember.

12:49.760 --> 12:50.770
Liar.

12:50.850 --> 12:52.930
-[Takemichi] Excuse me, Emma.
-Huh?

12:53.270 --> 12:57.350
This brother of yours, Izana Kurokawa,

12:57.440 --> 12:58.900
do you remember anything about him?

12:59.480 --> 13:01.320
I really doubt it.

13:01.400 --> 13:04.070
We were only together until I was three.

13:04.150 --> 13:05.280
[Takemichi] I see.

13:05.360 --> 13:06.610
Oh, but…

13:06.780 --> 13:09.280
he got along with Shinichiro.

13:09.370 --> 13:11.240
Huh? Shinichiro?

13:11.330 --> 13:12.750
With Shinichiro?

13:12.830 --> 13:14.290
[Emma chuckles softly]
Hold on a sec.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.960
Oh.

13:17.290 --> 13:18.920
[Emma] Ta-da!

13:19.000 --> 13:20.090
A tin?

13:20.170 --> 13:21.170
[Draken] What's this?

13:21.250 --> 13:23.960
This turned up
when we went through Shinichiro's stuff.

13:24.760 --> 13:26.180
A bunch of letters.

13:26.760 --> 13:29.720
Oh. That's from Izana Kurokawa?

13:29.800 --> 13:32.890
Wait. You mean they're all from him?

13:32.970 --> 13:35.640
Yeah. I haven't read them though.

13:35.730 --> 13:38.810
Looking at all these letters,
they must have gotten along great.

13:38.900 --> 13:41.190
"Gotten along" isn't the word…

13:41.650 --> 13:43.440
[Draken] This is kind of frightening.

13:48.360 --> 13:50.320
[Emma] So, did you find out anything?

13:50.410 --> 13:51.580
[sighs]

13:51.660 --> 13:54.370
They're all just about
what happened that day.

13:54.910 --> 13:57.670
This is probably the very first letter.

13:57.750 --> 13:58.920
Huh?

13:59.000 --> 14:01.040
[Draken] "Dear Shinichiro."

14:01.670 --> 14:04.050
"Thank you for visiting the other day."

14:04.710 --> 14:06.170
"It's nice to have a family."

14:06.260 --> 14:07.260
[gasps]

14:07.340 --> 14:09.800
[Takemichi] <i>So Shinichiro went to see him.</i>

14:10.800 --> 14:13.760
[Draken] He must have learned
about Izana from someone.

14:15.560 --> 14:16.930
I get it now.

14:20.350 --> 14:21.400
[all] Huh?

14:22.690 --> 14:25.570
I'm going out for a little fresh air.

14:25.650 --> 14:26.650
Huh?

14:29.490 --> 14:31.450
-[door closes]
-I wonder what's up with Mikey.

14:32.160 --> 14:33.330
TO SHINICHIRO SANO

14:35.370 --> 14:37.660
[Draken] "Dear Shinichiro.

14:38.250 --> 14:40.210
My head's been aching a lot lately.

14:40.790 --> 14:42.080
It hurts bad.

14:42.170 --> 14:43.880
I bet it's his fault.

14:44.800 --> 14:46.880
Don't tell me about Manjiro anymore."

14:46.960 --> 14:48.340
[gasps]

14:48.420 --> 14:49.800
[sighs]

14:50.720 --> 14:53.260
[Emma] He wanted… a family.

14:53.350 --> 14:54.430
Huh?

14:55.010 --> 14:58.770
I was able to get a family,
but my brother…

15:01.060 --> 15:02.480
[Emma] I'll get us more tea.

15:02.560 --> 15:04.320
[cups clanking]

15:04.400 --> 15:05.440
Oh.

15:07.070 --> 15:08.070
[door opens]

15:08.150 --> 15:09.150
[door closes]

15:09.240 --> 15:12.740
Izana Kurokawa was abandoned by his family
when he was little.

15:13.240 --> 15:17.410
Shinichiro, the first one
to ever visit him,

15:17.490 --> 15:20.080
must have been his only support.

15:20.710 --> 15:22.370
[Draken] <i>So what would he think of Mikey?</i>

15:23.130 --> 15:27.000
[Takemichi] <i>That's a good point.
He took over BLACK DRAGON from Shinichiro.</i>

15:27.590 --> 15:32.300
<i>But if he was told that BLACK DRAGON
was for Mikey to take over,</i>

15:32.930 --> 15:35.140
<i>how would Izana Kurokawa feel?</i>

15:36.850 --> 15:38.060
He was jealous?

15:38.140 --> 15:39.140
Yeah.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.560
He had an intense envy of Mikey.

15:42.350 --> 15:43.690
And hatred.

15:44.270 --> 15:46.230
Something's always bothered me.

15:46.360 --> 15:48.690
-What?
-When Toman was formed,

15:49.280 --> 15:53.530
the ninth leader of BLACK DRAGON,
Shion Madarame, told us this.

15:53.610 --> 15:56.370
Carry on the will of the eighth leader!

15:56.450 --> 16:02.790
BLACK DRAGON will crush
Manjiro Sano and Tokyo Manji Gang!

16:03.370 --> 16:04.920
"The will of the eighth leader"?

16:05.960 --> 16:09.380
The eighth leader of BLACK DRAGON
was Izana Kurokawa.

16:09.460 --> 16:10.630
That's right.

16:10.710 --> 16:14.220
When the ninth generation BLACK DRAGON
attacked Kazutora,

16:15.180 --> 16:18.260
Izana Kurokawa could have planned it
so he could crush Mikey

16:18.810 --> 16:21.230
without Shinichiro finding out.

16:21.810 --> 16:24.270
He may have done it
out of a personal grudge.

16:24.770 --> 16:27.230
And now that Shinichiro is gone,

16:27.900 --> 16:30.900
he's formed Tenjiku
and put his plan into motion himself

16:30.990 --> 16:34.610
<i>so he can crush Mikey for sure this time.</i>

16:36.120 --> 16:38.740
<i>To crush his blood relative,
his own brother.</i>

16:42.200 --> 16:43.620
[Chifuyu] I see.

16:44.120 --> 16:47.630
I never thought this would involve
Toman's own founding.

16:48.090 --> 16:49.090
[Takemichi] Chifuyu…

16:49.840 --> 16:52.050
I told you this because I trust you.

16:52.130 --> 16:53.220
[Chifuyu] Oh, okay.

16:53.800 --> 16:56.430
But from now on, I'm working on my own.

16:56.510 --> 16:59.100
-Huh?
-I can't drag you into this again.

16:59.180 --> 17:01.180
Huh? Why would you say that now?!

17:01.770 --> 17:03.230
Naoto's dead.

17:03.310 --> 17:04.600
What?

17:04.690 --> 17:08.020
[Takemichi]
I really can't go back to the future.

17:08.730 --> 17:10.320
This is my last chance.

17:11.610 --> 17:14.530
This conflict with Tenjiku
will end with a compromise.

17:15.110 --> 17:17.030
Toman and Tenjiku will become one

17:17.610 --> 17:20.080
and Mikey will be put in charge of it.

17:20.580 --> 17:24.620
My life was nothing but suffering.

17:25.660 --> 17:30.790
[Takemichi] <i>Izana Kurokawa and the person
who made use of his hatred, Tetta Kisaki…</i>

17:31.380 --> 17:33.510
Mikey will fall into their hands.

17:34.340 --> 17:35.720
Before that happens,

17:35.800 --> 17:38.760
I will put an end
to this rotten sibling rivalry.

17:40.300 --> 17:42.890
I will kill Kisaki and Izana.

17:44.020 --> 17:45.890
Even if we end up killing each other.

17:47.440 --> 17:49.650
Please understand, Chifuyu.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.270
I'm begging you.

17:53.190 --> 17:54.690
What about First Division?

17:56.610 --> 17:58.280
This is my personal fight.

17:58.360 --> 18:00.240
Then tell them that.

18:00.320 --> 18:01.330
What?

18:01.780 --> 18:04.240
[Chifuyu] When you called me here,
I told everyone to come.

18:05.080 --> 18:06.540
Listen, Takemitchy,

18:07.080 --> 18:09.370
this isn't just a simple sibling rivalry.

18:09.960 --> 18:12.540
Shinichiro founded that legendary gang.

18:13.000 --> 18:15.710
Then Izana Kurokawa turned them evil.

18:16.300 --> 18:18.430
And Mikey crushed them.

18:19.010 --> 18:21.720
Those events led to the founding of Toman.

18:22.810 --> 18:24.010
Chifuyu.

18:25.600 --> 18:29.100
[Chifuyu] Those events led me to meet him.

18:29.980 --> 18:34.860
This sibling rivalry is central
to all of us in Toman.

18:34.940 --> 18:37.150
And to everyone in First Division.

18:37.650 --> 18:42.030
So you need to talk with everyone
and ask them what they want to do.

18:42.570 --> 18:44.160
That's the captain's responsibility!

18:44.240 --> 18:46.450
[♪ inspiring music playing]

18:46.540 --> 18:48.160
[all] We've got to fight them!

18:48.250 --> 18:50.620
You guys… But…

18:50.710 --> 18:53.540
That Izana Kurokawa dude ticks me off!

18:53.630 --> 18:55.960
An enemy of Mikey is an enemy of Toman!

18:56.050 --> 18:57.590
That's just common sense.

18:57.670 --> 19:01.180
[Akkun] Don't brush us off
by saying you'll go it alone.

19:01.260 --> 19:03.180
If you're ready to go down fighting,

19:03.550 --> 19:06.060
I'll sacrifice my life for you, Captain.

19:07.060 --> 19:08.060
Akkun…

19:08.600 --> 19:10.310
[Yamagishi] That's right, Takemichi.

19:10.390 --> 19:13.730
Besides, this is the greatest
sibling rivalry in history.

19:13.810 --> 19:16.070
A Gang Dex like me would never miss it!

19:16.150 --> 19:19.240
Don't you think
Mikey's family is awful complicated?

19:19.320 --> 19:20.900
I can't even figure it out.

19:20.990 --> 19:23.950
[laughs]
Don't cramp your pea-brain over it.

19:24.030 --> 19:25.200
[Makoto] What did you call me, Takuya?

19:25.280 --> 19:26.290
[laughter]

19:26.370 --> 19:28.000
Do you even understand it?

19:28.080 --> 19:29.750
[Takuya] Yeah. They're half-brothers…

19:29.830 --> 19:32.710
This division isn't as weak as you think.

19:33.750 --> 19:35.420
So don't shoulder your burden alone.

19:35.500 --> 19:37.340
[Akkun] I bet you think
it's like calluses.

19:37.420 --> 19:38.510
I do not!

19:38.590 --> 19:40.010
[Takemichi] <i>Thanks, you guys.</i>

19:41.470 --> 19:45.300
Okay! We'll now begin
the First Division strategy meeting!

19:45.390 --> 19:46.680
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

19:52.140 --> 19:53.850
[gang member]
Is First Division captain here?

19:53.940 --> 19:54.940
[all] Huh?

19:55.020 --> 19:57.360
What the heck? What bad timing.

19:58.480 --> 20:00.610
[Takemichi] <i>That's a Toman uniform.</i>

20:01.200 --> 20:03.320
<i>But… who's that?</i>

20:04.360 --> 20:05.450
[gang member] Get down here.

20:12.870 --> 20:13.960
He's here.

20:16.750 --> 20:17.750
[Takemichi] <i>Isn't that</i>

20:18.340 --> 20:19.550
<i>Fifth Division's Captain?</i>

20:20.550 --> 20:22.800
-This is bad, Takemitchy.
-Huh?

20:23.380 --> 20:26.260
[Chifuyu] He's the only guy in Toman
with a special position.

20:28.010 --> 20:29.810
Yo, Hanagaki.

20:30.310 --> 20:32.520
-Watch out, Takemitchy!
-Huh?

20:33.560 --> 20:34.560
TOKYO MANJI GANG

20:34.650 --> 20:37.980
-Hey! What do you think you're doing?
-Let go of me, damn it!

20:38.070 --> 20:39.520
Huh? What's going on?

20:39.610 --> 20:41.240
-[Mucho] Hanagaki.
-[grunts]

20:42.320 --> 20:43.360
[Takemichi grunts]

20:43.450 --> 20:44.530
[Yamagishi] Takemitchy!

20:46.110 --> 20:47.370
[coughs]

20:51.870 --> 20:53.040
[gasps]

20:53.120 --> 20:54.540
What the heck are you doing?

20:54.620 --> 20:56.080
[grunting]

20:56.290 --> 20:57.580
Stop it, Mucho!

20:58.040 --> 20:59.040
[Takemichi] <i>Damn it!</i>

21:00.000 --> 21:02.130
There's no fighting
among Toman members, man!

21:02.800 --> 21:05.180
FIRST GENERATION TOKYO MANJI GANG

21:05.260 --> 21:06.760
What's your goddamn problem?

21:06.840 --> 21:09.640
-What did Takemichi ever do to you?
-[grunts]

21:09.720 --> 21:12.600
[♪ tense music playing]

21:16.600 --> 21:20.360
That damn Izana, making more work for me.

21:20.860 --> 21:22.280
[Takemichi] <i>Izana?</i>

21:22.820 --> 21:24.950
-Sanzu.
-[Sanzu] Yes?

21:26.200 --> 21:27.320
[Mucho] Put him in the car.

21:31.990 --> 21:34.200
[coughs, retching]

21:35.660 --> 21:37.710
[Takemichi] <i>Where the heck am I?</i>

21:38.960 --> 21:41.250
<i>Damn. I can't see a thing.</i>

21:42.130 --> 21:43.760
[Mucho] You awake, Hanagaki?

21:45.630 --> 21:46.760
Good.

21:48.300 --> 21:52.140
We're in the middle of a fight
with Tenjiku, you know.

21:52.720 --> 21:54.810
[Takemichi] It's the wrong time
for this kind of thing.

21:55.810 --> 21:57.850
Look beside you, Hanagaki.

21:57.940 --> 21:59.230
-[clicks]
-[light clanks]

21:59.310 --> 22:00.400
[grunts]

22:00.480 --> 22:02.360
All the key players are here.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.650
What?

22:04.740 --> 22:06.990
[Mucho] Let's get started, shall we?

22:07.860 --> 22:08.950
[Takemichi] <i>Huh?</i>

22:09.570 --> 22:11.490
<i>Inupi and Koko?</i>

22:11.990 --> 22:14.450
<i>What are these two doing here?</i>

22:16.080 --> 22:18.120
[♪ closing theme music]

23:44.920 --> 23:46.920
Translated by Brian Athey
